### ④ 타이포그래피
- **폰트 페어링**:
  - 영문: Roboto (Apache 2.0) — Workday Canvas 표준
  - 한글: Noto Sans KR (OFL)
- **위계**:
  - Display: 56px / 400 / 1.14 / 0
  - H1: 40px / 400 / 1.2 / 0
  - H2: 28px / 400 / 1.29 / 0
  - H3: 22px / 500 / 1.36 / 0
  - Body Large: 16px / 400 / 1.5 / 0
  - Body: 14px / 400 / 1.43 / 0
  - Body Small: 12px / 400 / 1.33 / 0
  - Caption: 11px / 500 / 1.36 / 0.04em (uppercase)

